# GitHub Actions naming (Scheme A)

When adding or editing workflows under `.github/workflows/`:

1. Follow Scheme A in `docs/runbooks/github-actions-naming.md`.
2. Display name: must be `"<Area>: <purpose>"` with Area in {CI, CD, Ops, Maint}.
3. New workflow filenames: `<area>-<purpose>[-cadence].yml` (`ci-`, `cd-`, `ops-`, `maint-`).
4. Keep plan IDs out of workflow display name; put them in comments/docs.
